# Linkme

> Linkme is an all-in-one platform for creators, businesses, and agencies to
> build a link-in-bio presence, publish social content, automate audience
> engagement, understand performance, and sell online.

Linkme brings a creator's public profile, audience tools, and storefront
together behind one URL. Core capabilities include:

- Customizable link-in-bio profiles with links, media, social destinations,
  contact capture, QR codes, and analytics.
- Post to All for publishing immediately or scheduling content across connected
  YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, X, Threads, and LinkedIn accounts.
- Instagram automations triggered by keywords or comments, with automated
  replies, direct-message sequences, and contact capture.
- Shops for physical merchandise and digital products, including
  print-on-demand merchandise without upfront inventory.
- Free and paid online courses with video lessons, sections, downloadable
  materials, checkout, and learner access.
- Email lists, campaigns, sales tools, and performance analytics.
- Multi-profile management, roster-wide analytics, leads, and team access for
  agencies and organizations.

Plan availability and usage limits change over time. The pricing page is the
authoritative source for current plans and limits.

